  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen the bio of a user gets long enough it becomes scrollable. If it is scrollable you can scroll through it by dragging it with your cursor or with your mouse wheel / thumb stick.\n\nThis how ever only works on your own bio, you cannot drag the bio of other users or move it with your mouse wheel / thumb stick. \n\n** Reproduction Steps:**\n\n1. Launch VRChat\n\n2. Open your Main Menu Social Tab\n\n3. Open the user profile of someone with a long bio\n\n4. Try dragging the bio view or moving it with your mouse wheel / thumb stick\n\nIf you do this you notice it wont work.\n\n# Expected Behaviour:\n\nYou should be able to scroll through the bio of someone by dragging it or with your mouse wheel / thumb stick. Just like you can on live.",
